OL,3,GNEWSADouble-decker bus crashes into
OL,4,Arailway bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains were stopped after a
OL,7,Fdouble-decker bus crashed into a
OL,8,Frailway bridge in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Frailway bridge over New Road in
OL,12,FKibworth shortly after 07:25 GMT on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Network Rail said
OL,16,Ftrains were temporarily stopped "as a
OL,17,Fprecaution" while the bus was removed
OL,18,Ffrom under the bridge, and the railway
OL,19,Flines reopened at about 08:45.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
